- seensettings - command that allows you to set the settings for adding `seen` reaction to messages on a channel;
- zamowieniegrafika - command that displays a modal that serves as a template for ordering graphics, can be edited via `edytuj` parameter and original order `message_id`;
- embed - sends embed message from json file;
- role - list of roles that can be selected through reactions, set in json file;

